choose-if: slfp_local_gov = 1
unavailable-subtitle: The SLFP does not have any influence in the DDC's

Despite how powerless the DDC's are and our lack of authority on security forces, we were able to organise and agitate for aid provisions and shelter to the displaced. 

The show of good will increased our support among effected communities, rebuilding trust slowly.

- @next: Continue...

